Z||000000||TheFiero64||05-08-2000||03:56 PM||||Check it out the New England Fiero Association made the front page of the Bristol news in Conn.. It's Great   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> About time our Fieros make front page news. Too bad I missed the show    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> I will be there next time. They got a few things wrong but it was still great. There were actually 19 not (18) Fieros. Also, we are generally based throughout New England and actually don't have any members in Waterbury as stated in the article.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.zwire.com/site/news.cfm?newsid=417312&BRD=1643&PAG=461&dept_id=10486" TARGET=_blank><B>Click here to see it</B></A> <P><p>[This message has been edited by TheFiero64 (edited 05-09-2000).]||||reg||10
